# GLOS's one-colour glyphs (docs/gui.md 1.11): a name GLOS's programs ask for (gui_glyph), and the Font Awesome
# Free icon it is (solid style, 6.7.2; icons CC BY 4.0, the font SIL OFL 1.1: THIRD_PARTY.md).
# tools/mkicons.py (`make icons`) draws each at 14 pixels into a 16 by 16 mask, sdk/gui/glyphs.c, which
# the toolkit draws in the theme's text colour.
new             file
open            folder-open
save            floppy-disk
cut             scissors
copy            copy
paste           paste
undo            rotate-left
redo            rotate-right
delete          trash
find            magnifying-glass
print           print
bold            bold
italic          italic
underline       underline
add             plus
remove          minus
close           xmark
back            arrow-left
forward         arrow-right
up              arrow-up
down            arrow-down
home            house
refresh         rotate
settings        gear
info            circle-info
help            circle-question
warning         triangle-exclamation
star            star
zoom-in         magnifying-glass-plus
zoom-out        magnifying-glass-minus
play            play
pause           pause
stop            stop
volume          volume-high
mute            volume-xmark
lock            lock
calendar        calendar-days
mail            envelope
edit            pen
filter          filter
more            ellipsis
check           check
folder          folder
folder-new      folder-plus
list            list
grid            table-cells
properties      sliders
terminal        terminal
download        download
upload          upload
link            link
eject           eject
power           power-off
menu            bars
view            eye
